---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — KOUNS Strategic Advisory"
  description="KOUNS Privacy Policy — How we protect and manage client intelligence and data."
>
  <main class="page-width" style="padding-block: 72px 96px; max-width: 900px;">
    <div style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
      <a href="/" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 24px; text-decoration: none;">
        ← Back to Home
      </a>
      <div class="section-tag" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Legal &amp; Compliance</div>
      <h1 style="font-size: clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 48px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.15;">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p style="margin-top: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px;">
        Effective Date: January 1, 2026 • Last Updated: August 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-content" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 36px; color: var(--ink); font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.75;">
      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 14px; color: var(--ink);">1. Commitment to Confidentiality &amp; Privacy</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--muted);">
          At KOUNS (“KOUNS”, “we”, “our”, or “us”), we recognize that strategic advisory, commercial growth intelligence, and brand architectures involve sensitive business information. We are strictly committed to safeguarding the privacy and confidentiality of our clients, executive partners, and website visitors.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 14px; color: var(--ink);">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          We collect information only to the extent necessary to deliver high-impact strategic advisory and manage our client relationships:
        </p>
        <ul style="padding-left: 24px; color: var(--muted); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
          <li><strong>Contact Inquiries:</strong> Name, work email address, company name, role, and strategic objectives provided when scheduling a dialogue or contacting us via <a href="mailto:contact@kounsconsulting.com" style="color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500;">contact@kounsconsulting.com</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Advisory Engagement Data:</strong> Commercial metrics, market research inputs, customer data signals, and organizational roadmaps shared under mutual non-disclosure agreements (NDA).</li>
          <li><strong>Technical Analytics:</strong> Anonymized usage data, page response metrics, and standard server log metadata to maintain site security and performance.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 14px; color: var(--ink);">3. How We Use Information</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          The information we collect is used strictly for:
        </p>
        <ul style="padding-left: 24px; color: var(--muted); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
          <li>Delivering bespoke growth strategy, brand platforming, and business development advisory services.</li>
          <li>Responding to partnership inquiries and scheduling introductory strategy sessions.</li>
          <li>Sending requested strategic insights, research briefs, and industry perspectives.</li>
          <li>Maintaining legal and regulatory compliance across global strategic jurisdictions.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 14px; color: var(--ink);">4. Confidentiality &amp; Non-Disclosure</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--muted);">
          All client strategic data, competitive positioning assets, and internal roadmaps are treated under strict professional confidentiality. We never sell, lease, or monetize client data or executive contact details to third parties under any circumstances.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 14px; color: var(--ink);">5. Data Retention &amp; Security</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--muted);">
          We apply industry-standard administrative, physical, and encrypted technical measures to protect all data against unauthorized access, loss, or alteration. Engagement materials are securely archived or deleted in accordance with client contract terms upon project completion.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 14px; color: var(--ink);">6. Your Rights &amp; Inquiries</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--muted);">
          Depending on your location (including rights under GDPR, UK DPA, and global privacy standards), you may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal contact data at any time by contacting our practice lead:
        </p>
        <div style="margin-top: 16px; padding: 20px 24px; background: var(--paper-2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px;">
          <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink);">KOUNS Global Strategic Practice</p>
          <p style="margin: 4px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px;">Direct Compliance Email: <a href="mailto:contact@kounsconsulting.com" style="color: var(--accent-dark); font-weight: 600;">contact@kounsconsulting.com</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
